From: SHiP <noreply@ship.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] form: include ROOT/RVersion.hxx instead of RVersion.h

ROOT 6.42 deprecates RVersion.h with a #warning, which -Werror turns
into a build failure. ROOT/RVersion.hxx defines the same macros and also
exists in older releases. phlex main no longer has this file.
---
 form/root_storage/root_rntuple_write_container.hpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/form/root_storage/root_rntuple_write_container.hpp b/form/root_storage/root_rntuple_write_container.hpp
--- a/form/root_storage/root_rntuple_write_container.hpp
+++ b/form/root_storage/root_rntuple_write_container.hpp
@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@
 
 #include "storage/storage_write_association.hpp"
 
-#include <RVersion.h>
+#include <ROOT/RVersion.hxx>
 
 #include <memory>
 #include <string>
